&lt;h4 style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;12lll1&quot; data-start=&quot;2728&quot; data-end=&quot;2744&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;What We Offer&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/h4&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Competitive salary and bonus.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Excellent medical coverage through BUPA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Professional development opportunities&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Supportive culture that celebrates and rewards success&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Informal work environment&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Employee Assistance Programs&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Volunteer days&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1ypf1c2&quot; data-start=&quot;2778&quot; data-end=&quot;2799&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Hybrid working.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1hr9wvq&quot; data-start=&quot;2818&quot; data-end=&quot;2878&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Opportunity to help launch Guidepoint&#39;s Manchester office and shape our UK campus recruitment programme&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;if6smq&quot; data-start=&quot;2949&quot; data-end=&quot;3014&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;International exposure within a global Talent Acquisition team.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot; data-section-id=&quot;1662r9m&quot; data-start=&quot;3015&quot; data-end=&quot;3084&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Collaborative team environment and regular social events.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About Guidepoint:&lt;/strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Guidepoint powers end-to-end research workflows for the world’s best research teams.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;Backed by a global network of more than&lt;strong&gt; 2 million experts and over 1,600 employees,&lt;/strong&gt; Guidepoint delivers real-time access to expertise, primary research, and actionable knowledge that help organizations make informed decisions. Through consultations, surveys, events, proprietary content, and AI-enabled tools, we support every stage of the decision-making process—from developing hypotheses and gathering insights to validating assumptions and building conviction for critical decisions.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;At Guidepoint, our success relies on the diversity of our employees, experts, and clients, which enables us to foster meaningful connections and a broad range of perspectives. We are committed to creating an inclusive and welcoming environment where individuals of all backgrounds, identities, and experiences can contribute and succeed.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-HYBRID&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style=&quot;line-height: 1.4;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 12pt;&quot;&gt;#LI-DT1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;Find more English Speaking Jobs in United Kingdom on Arbeitnow

&lt;p&gt;The CRM Account Director is responsible for building and growing strategic client relationships while ensuring clients realise measurable value from their CRM investment. Acting as a trusted advisor, they work closely with senior client stakeholders to shape CRM strategy, drive adoption, identify growth opportunities and ensure successful delivery across marketing, technology and data initiatives.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;The role combines commercial account leadership with strategic CRM consulting, partnering with internal cross-functional teams to deliver outstanding client outcomes and long-term customer success.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Job Description&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Strategic Client Leadership&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Build trusted relationships with senior client stakeholders, including CRM Directors, Marketing Directors, Digital Directors and C-suite executives.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop a deep understanding of each client&#39;s business objectives, commercial priorities and CRM maturity.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead strategic account planning to ensure CRM programmes align with wider business goals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Act as the executive point of contact for strategic accounts.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;CRM Strategy&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Advise clients on CRM best practice across customer acquisition, onboarding, engagement, retention, loyalty and reactivation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients define CRM roadmaps and transformation strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Recommend opportunities to improve customer journeys through personalisation, automation, AI and first-party data.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Translate business objectives into measurable CRM programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Customer Success&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Own overall client health, satisfaction and long-term success.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead Quarterly Business Reviews (QBRs) and Executive Business Reviews.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Monitor adoption, utilisation and business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure clients achieve measurable ROI against agreed success metrics.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proactively identify risks and drive mitigation plans.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Commercial Growth&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Identify opportunities to expand client relationships through additional products and services.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop account growth plans aligned to client priorities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead commercial conversations around renewals, upsell and cross-sell opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Work closely with Sales to execute account expansion strategies.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Project &amp;amp; Delivery Oversight&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with Delivery, Product, Engineering and Solution Consulting teams to ensure successful implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Ensure projects remain aligned with agreed business outcomes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Escalate and resolve delivery risks where required.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Maintain executive visibility throughout complex programmes.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Data &amp;amp; Insights&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Use customer data and campaign performance to identify optimisation opportunities.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present strategic recommendations based on business insights.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Help clients maximise value product offerings.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive a culture of continuous optimisation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Executive Communication&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Present confidently to executive stakeholders.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate strategic workshops.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Influence senior decision makers.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Produce clear executive-level recommendations and business cases.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;PEOPLE &amp;amp; CULTURE AT ZETA&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;Zeta considers applicants for employment without regard to, and does not discriminate on the basis of an individual’s sex, race, color, religion, age, disability, status as a veteran, or national or ethnic origin; nor does Zeta discriminate on the basis of sexual orientation, gender identity or expression.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;We’re committed to building a workplace culture of trust and belonging, so everyone feels invited to bring their whole selves to work. We provide a forum for employees to celebrate, support and advocate for one another. Learn more about our commitment to diversity, equity and inclusion here: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zetaglobal.com/blog/a-look-into-zetas-ergs/&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;https://zetaglobal.com/blog/a-look-into-zetas-ergs/&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:true,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:160,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;ZETA IN THE NEWS!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335551550&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335551620&amp;quot;:1,&amp;quot;335559685&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559737&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://zetaglobal.com/press/?cat=press-releases&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-contrast=&quot;none&quot;&gt;https://zetaglobal.com/press/?cat=press-releases&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/a&gt;&lt;span data-ccp-props=&quot;{&amp;quot;134233117&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;134233118&amp;quot;:false,&amp;quot;201341983&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559738&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559739&amp;quot;:0,&amp;quot;335559740&amp;quot;:240}&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
